invariant: INV-33
file: webpki.c
catches: webpki_auth_test
reason: under pins alone the list framing refuses an entry after the
  leaf of exactly CH_WEBPKI_LEAF_PIN_CERT_MAX bytes, the largest a
  Certificate message carries, so the last accepted size moves one byte
  short of the one docs/decisions.md 65 names. Entries over the walk's
  cap still pass; test/webpki_leaf_pins.h's rows with an entry at the cap
  after the leaf, which want it accepted, object.

--- old
        rc = webpki_read_entry(&r, CH_WEBPKI_LEAF_PIN_CERT_MAX, &cert, &cert_len, alert);
--- new
        rc = webpki_read_entry(&r, CH_WEBPKI_LEAF_PIN_CERT_MAX - 1, &cert, &cert_len, alert);
